[2026-07-19T11:17:56.754Z] [INFO]         "content": "{\"body\":\"Closes #781.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- fan one web-search result set out to as many as three distinct source fetches, preserve the URL/result pairing, and cite every successful source in the synthesis;\\n- accept normalized `web-capture shared-dialog` JSON in the shared-dialog converter, including explicit unsupported-provider diagnostics;\\n- add a complete case study from the supplied ChatGPT/Google shares, real Chromium captures, project-native searches, and an installed Agent CLI replay.\\n\\n## Product finding\\n\\nThe captured evidence supports a 12 V / 2 A (24 W) requirement. The strongest Amazon India candidate found is [Tonton ASIN B0CG66QYWN](https://www.amazon.in/Tonton-Adapter-Charger-Interchangeable-3-5x1-35/dp/B0CG66QYWN), but it remains conditional: Amazon's live page returned its automated-access response, and the indexed listing did not establish polarity or current stock. The case study therefore requires seller confirmation of fixed 12 V output, a center-positive 3.5 x 1.35 mm tip, stock, and returnability rather than claiming guaranteed compatibility.\\n\\n## Reproduction and verification\\n\\n- Before the fix, the new whole-task regression failed with one fetch instead of three. It now checks all three fetches, facts, and exact source URLs.\\n- `cargo test --all-features`: 1816 passed, 0 failed, 2 ignored.\\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`: passed.\\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, hardcoded-language audit, total-closure audit, file-size/worker-line/WASM-size gates, and changelog check: passed.\\n- Release build: passed.\\n- Installed Agent CLI 0.25.0 against the optimized Formal AI server: 1 search, 3 planned fetches, and all 3 fetch executions.\\n- ChatGPT direct HTML and normalized adapter conversion: byte-identical 35-event, 48,281-byte exports.\\n\\nAgent CLI currently exits after those executions when it receives an `unknown` finish reason (the client links upstream issue #249), so the real E2E checks the live tool boundary and the deterministic whole-task test checks the following synthesis and citations. Three retries and a sequential-fetch control are retained in the evidence.\\n\\nResearch record: [`docs/case-studies/issue-781`](https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/tree/issue-781-c52371d60a25/docs/case-studies/issue-781)\\n\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:47:34Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/29680389544/job/88175367141\",\"name\":\"Detect Changes\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:46:20Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI/CD Pipeline\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:47:29Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/29680389544/job/88175367201\",\"name\":\"Version Modification Check\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:46:20Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI/CD Pipeline\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:46:18Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/29680389544/job/88175375685\",\"name\":\"Create Changelog PR\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:46:24Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI/CD Pipeline\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:48:39Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/29680389544/job/88175472210\",\"name\":\"Changelog Fragment Check\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:47:36Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI/CD Pipeline\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:50:56Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/actions/runs/2