[2026-07-19T11:18:00.351Z] [INFO]         "content": "{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary --\\u003e\\n## Working session summary\\n\\nImplemented and finalized [PR #795](https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/795), now ready for review.\\n\\nKey results:\\n\\n- Web research now fetches and cites up to three independent sources.\\n- Shared-dialog conversion accepts normalized ChatGPT/Google capture JSON.\\n- Added reproducing tests, multilingual diagnostics, real browser captures, Agent CLI E2E, and a complete [research case study](https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/tree/issue-781-c52371d60a25/docs/case-studies/issue-781).\\n- Best conditional candidate: Tonton Amazon India ASIN B0CG66QYWN. Seller confirmation of 12 V, center-positive 3.5 × 1.35 mm, stock, and returnability remains necessary.\\n- Fresh CI for commit `5e6ab993` is fully green: tests, lint, coverage, browser E2E, Agent CLI E2E, and package build.\\n- PR is clean against current `main`; worktree is clean and no reviewer feedback is outstanding.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\",\"created\":\"2026-07-19T08:43:25Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🤖 Solution Draft Log\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-5.6 Sol\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $75.471451\\n\\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\\n- 1.5M / 200K (755%) input tokens, 106.3K / 128K (83%) output tokens\\n\\nTotal: (1.5M + 55.6M cached) input tokens, 106.3K output tokens, $75.471451 cost\\n\\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\\n- Requested: `gpt-5.6-sol`\\n- Thinking level: medium (~15999 tokens)\\n- **Model: GPT-5.6 Sol** (`gpt-5.6-sol`)\\n\\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (19479KB)\\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/df9e27b37bbec39a70f368623a150be7/raw/9aec1ae427d70518f4c65e3bf52e9e2ca83a6813/tmp-solution-draft-log-pr-1784450613085.txt.log.txt)\\n\\n---\\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*\",\"created\":\"2026-07-19T08:43:44Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}\n{\"body\":\"## ✅ Ready to merge\\n\\nThis pull request is now ready to be merged:\\n- All CI checks have passed\\n- No merge conflicts\\n- No pending changes\\n\\n---\\n*Monitored by hive-mind with --auto-restart-until-mergeable flag*\",\"created\":\"2026-07-19T08:46:11Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}\n{\"body\":\"We need make the analysis deeper and fully implement vision from the issue using auto learning, and same task execution using Formal AI via Agent CLI.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe need to make sure we do deep research using web search, web fetch and so on using OpenCode available tools, it should be multi turn tool calling, first we prioritize finding original/authentic DC adapter, we can also search all official sources for compatible manufacturers, and only if everything in that search fails we try to find compatible fallback options, like general DC adapter with compatible characteristics if port itself is not available, we can try to search conversion adapter and so on.\\r\\n\\r\\nThat should be done using building associative links network (not neural net), just knowledge network with all facts we know and possible options, so we provide not only the most expensive option that has charger + multiple adapters, we must provide all other options including options with 2 separate items - conversion adapter and charger, and by default we should list cheaper options first.\\r\\n\\r\\nEverything must be solved by generalization, not specific to only ability to search chargers, it can be any product with any constraints and requirements. So our system should be useful for the widest possible range of cases.\\r\\n\\r\\nSee our contributing guidelines, testing guidelines, vision, roadmap and so on. I expect this pull request to cover the most ambitious of requirements through generalization of logic, reasoning, advancing our meta algorithm to the highest possible potential. If you see something that still obsolete or contradicts generalization - it must be fixed.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt is ok to change architecture to move toward our goals of generalization in any place you touch.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease plan and execute everything in this single pull request, you have unlimited time and context, as context auto-compacts and you can continue indefinitely, until it is each and every requirement fully addressed, and everything is totally done.\",\"created\":\"2026-07-19T11:09:59Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}\n{\"body\":\"🤖 **AI Work Session Started**\\n\\nStarting automated work session at 2026-07-19T11:17:30.875Z\\n\\nThe PR has been converted to draft mode while work is in progress.\\n\\n_This comment marks the beginning of an AI work session. Please wait for the session to finish, and provide your feedback._\",\"created\":\"2026-07-19T11:17:35Z\",\"user\":\"konard\"}",
