[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           " ",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// How many search → fetch rounds one question may take.",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+///",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// One round can only answer a question whose every aspect happens to sit on",
