[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// bound exists because the loop's own stopping rule — no aspect of the question",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// left uncovered — can be unreachable when the missing fact simply is not on",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// the open web, and a research loop must terminate either way. Three rounds",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// fit inside the driver's turn budget with the fetches they imply.",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+const MAX_RESEARCH_ROUNDS: usize = 3;",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           " pub(super) fn plan_web_research_step(",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "     messages: &[ChatMessage],",
