[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// reach documents the first could not. Returns `None` when the question is",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+/// fully covered or the round budget is spent — both mean it is time to answer.",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+fn plan_deeper_round(",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+    tool_names: &[&str],",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+    progress: &Progress,",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+    query: &str,",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+) -> Option<AgenticPlan> {",
[2026-07-19T11:43:03.496Z] [INFO]           "+    if progress.count(Capability::Search) >= MAX_RESEARCH_ROUNDS {",
