t is **not yet wired into the agentic answer path** — a live session doesn't yet return tiered, cheapest-first option lists. That's the next step, and it's the gap between \"the engine exists and is tested\" and \"the reviewer's scenario works end to end.\"\n\n---\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/comments/5016061122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}
